\\cong$", "MATH_0012": "$\\phi : F_1 \\to F_2$", "MATH_0013": "$1$", "MATH_0014": "$f : \\mathcal{S}_1 \\to \\mathcal{S}_2$", "MATH_0015": "$\\phi$", "MATH_0016": "$2$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-setoid-fibres}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{definition-functor-into-2-category}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-2-category-fibred-setoids}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:69cf606aa9b50eb6068cac867de9d6732f17c5bfc131d7d9b702124495d03d19", "source_math_skeleton_hash": "sha256:bd4fcb3cf8c389b31bb621a0261a5f77bd4143d3cd96e9046ab7733b7d2598d2", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:437356af38285951572d1905a18fdd3f98e3a6ac7d84f6bb783b1e0601025daa", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category. The construction of\nLemma <REF_0001>\npart (2) gives a functor\n<MATHSEG_0001>the 2-category of categories<MATHSEG_0002>fibred in setoids over <MATHSEG_0003>the category of categories<MATHSEG_0004>fibred in sets over <MATHSEG_0005>\n(see\nDefinition <REF_0002>).\nThis functor is an equivalence in the following sense:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> for any two 1-morphisms <MATH_0002>\nwith <MATH_0003> there exists a unique 2-isomorphism <MATH_0004>,\n<STRUCT_0003> for any morphism <MATH_0005>\nthere exists a 1-morphism <MATH_0006>\nwith <MATH_0007>, and\n<STRUCT_0004> any category fibred in sets <MATH_0008> is equal to <MATH_0009>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\nIn particular, defining <MATH_0010> by the\nrule <MATH_0011>, we have\n<MATHSEG_0006>-isomorphism<MATHSEG_0007>\nMore precisely, given any map <MATH_0012> there exists a\n<MATH_0013>-morphism <MATH_0014> which induces\n<MATH_0015> on isomorphism classes of objects and\nwhich is unique up to unique <MATH_0016>-isomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:df2b8637858e71f6312e676a1bf9303d7f038d12100b6dd963ba82f1dbed93df", "unit_id": "tag:04SC:statement"}
