e final assertion use\nLemma <REF_0003>\nto see that the right hand side is equal to\n<MATH_0018>\nand apply (1) and (2) above.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:17be150ef8f461004a2d21ebe301c372ba5cf87f0e8c4752bf164e4aca7f4f74", "unit_id": "tag:04SC:proof"}
